: Alamosa's average low has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.15\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.04 to +0.25), about +1.3\u00b0F since 1933. Alamosa's average high has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.21\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.07 to +0.36), about +2.0\u00b0F since 1933.","t_mon":"Lows rose in 2 of 12 months. Highs rose in 6 of 12 months.","t_rain":"Rain and snow: no clear long-term change","p_rain":"Alamosa's yearly precipitation shows no clear long-term change (+0.08 inches per decade, a range that includes zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 7.2 inches a year. The wettest year was 1969 (11.55 in); the driest, 1956 (3.40 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":false,"hi":true},"t_year":"2026 so far: 40 daily record highs, 3 daily record lows"}}